<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="top-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">TOKEN RADAR &middot; DEFI LLAMA SNAPSHOT <span id="as-of"></span></p>
      <h1>Which pre-token protocol is worth farming next?</h1>
      <p class="lede">Every protocol DefiLlama tracks that records no token, ranked by what its
      launch would be worth if it were priced like the tokens that already trade in its own
      category. No names are hard-coded: the ranking, the value and the farm plan are all
      derived from the snapshot's own figures.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="stats" id="stats"></dl>
  </div>
  <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Views">
    <button type="button" data-view="board" class="tab active">Ranked board</button>
    <button type="button" data-view="live" class="tab">Live tokens &mdash; already trading</button>
    <button type="button" data-view="model" class="tab">How the value is modelled</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section id="view-board" class="view">
    <div class="controls" role="search">
      <label>Search <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Protocol name or slug&hellip;" autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label>Category
        <select id="category"><option value="all">All categories</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Chain
        <select id="chain"><option value="all">All chains</option></select>
      </label>
      <label class="check"><input id="watchlist-only" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only</label>
